  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint activities of Trauma programme -  Part of the CAFOD exit strategy in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is essentially around  learning and exchange visits, experience sharing, monitoring activities done by CAFOD&#x2019;s staff ( based in Kigali or Kinshasa), as well as capacity building to partners according to expressed needs and advocacy work through media  and meetings. In 2012, a learning and exchange visit is planned with Rwanda agricultural board to learn from livelihoods successes and agricultural new technics. Quarterly meetings are planned and two trainings for partners&#x2019; staff will be done. As done in the last years, partners&#x2019; professionals and the CAFOD Programme staff will attend various meetings in the Mental Working Group and the Ministry of Health. The Newspaper &#x201C;Seed of Hope&#x201D; will be produced and Community survey will be done and published.</narrative>
  </description>
